~ start
Cyrus Rowe: Papers on a crate. A contract... for hired swords. Paid in advance.
Cyrus Rowe: Hang on - there's a wire on the lid-
do QuickTime.start("dodge_the_bolt")
if QuickTime.passed
	Cyrus Rowe: Ha! Missed me. Whoever set that was expecting company.
else
	Cyrus Rowe: Ow. That one found me.
	do Campaign.strain("cyrus", 12)
Prometheus Iliopoulos: Read the note in the margin. "Do not expect any of them back."
Cyrus Rowe: Whoever paid them means them to die here. I wonder if they know.
do Campaign.learn_clue("sellsword_contract")
Cyrus Rowe: And a purse beside it - their advance, not collected yet. They will not be needing it.
do Campaign.give_gold(200)
=> END
